    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"letting go\" sounds nice but honestly it feels impossible. everything is tied to me. my family, my job, everything. it feels like if i stopped, everything would just fall apart, but i'm also just so exhausted by it all. it feels like there's no way out of this cycle.",
